# MedShadow Project Structure

## Overview
MedShadow is a platform connecting students with medical shadowing opportunities. The codebase follows Next.js app router structure.

## Key Directories
- `src/app`: Contains the page routes using Next.js App Router
- `src/components`: Reusable UI components
- `src/styles`: Global styles and Tailwind configuration
- `src/models`: Database models
- `src/lib`: Utility functions
- `src/context`: React context providers

## Key Files
- [medshadow/src/app/page.tsx](mdc:medshadow/src/app/page.tsx): Homepage with hero section, partner institutions, and feature cards
- [medshadow/tailwind.config.js](mdc:medshadow/tailwind.config.js): Tailwind configuration including custom colors and spacing
- [styles/design-system.css](mdc:styles/design-system.css): Design system variables and component styles
